  {
    "id": 2007010110010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それでは！\r\n三峰とプロデューサーのオンライン飲み会、始めまーっす！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "002",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701011/2007010110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "始めまーす",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……って言っても飲み会じゃないけどな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010110020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "え～～Ｐたんノリ悪い～～\r\nたとえ飲み物がウーロン茶だって飲み会は飲み会だよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701011/2007010110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そもそもミーティング……まぁいいか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "で？\r\n飲み会だとして、結華はカメラつけてくれないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010110030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "えっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701011/2007010110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……えっ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010110040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "嘘でしょプロデューサー……\r\nカメラありなら先に言っといてもらわないと……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701011/2007010110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうなのか……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010110050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうだよ！　こっちは人前に出る時には\r\n化粧って手間が発生するんだから！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701011/2007010110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010110060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そういうのちゃんと考えてくれないと困るよ～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701011/2007010110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わ、悪い！　気が回らずに……！\r\n不都合あるなら今日はカメラはいいから──！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00381"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0549",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010110070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──まぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "off",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040070050",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200701011/2007010110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010110080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "当たり前に準備はしてるから？\r\n全然気にしなくていいんだけどね？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_bad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_bad",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701011/2007010110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……っ、結華……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010110090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "えへへ、ごめ～ん\r\nでも言ってることは本当だし～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701011/2007010110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010110100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰は別に『もしかしたら』で準備するの\r\n苦じゃないからいいけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701011/2007010110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010110110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "先に教えといてもらえた方がありがたい情報なのは\r\n確かだし～",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_bad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_bad",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701011/2007010110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ありがとう、肝に銘じておく",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2200
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それでまた背景もすごいな！\r\nオンラインなのしっかり楽しんでるじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010110120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いやー、せっかくだからと思って\r\n今日のためにいろいろ探したからちょっと見てよＰたん",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701011/2007010110120"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
